#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:87
msgid ""
"Work inside the Linux filesystem (``~/`` in WSL), **not** under ``/mnt/c/``."
" Building on the Windows-mounted drive is dramatically slower and can cause "
"file-permission and line-ending problems. Clone the repository into your WSL"
" home directory."
msgstr ""
"Radite unutar Linux datotečnog sustava (\\ ``~/`` u WSL-u), **ne** pod "
"``/mnt/c/``\\ . Izgradnja na Windows-montiranom disku dramatično je sporija "
"i može uzrokovati probleme s dozvolama datoteka i prekidima redaka. "
"Klonirajte repozitorij u svoj WSL kućni direktorij."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:92
msgid ""
"To open the project later: launch *Ubuntu* from the Start menu for a shell, "
"or from VS Code on Windows press :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+P` -> *WSL: Connect to "
"WSL*, then *File -> Open Folder* and pick the cloned repo in the Linux "
"filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Za kasnije otvaranje projekta: pokrenite *Ubuntu* iz izbornika Start za "
"ljusku, ili iz VS Codea na Windowsima pritisnite :kbd:`Ctrl+Shift+P` -> "
"*WSL: Connect to WSL*\\ , zatim *File -> Open Folder* i odaberite klonirani "
"repozitorij u Linux datotečnom sustavu."

